---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Pricing — Noven';
const description =
  'Noven pricing in plain numbers: a £30 audit, a £350 one-off Foundation setup, and ongoing monthly plans at £75 (Maintain), £125 (Grow) and £250 (Lead). No lock-ins.';

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'AI assistant visibility for service businesses',
  serviceType: 'Business visibility in AI assistant recommendations',
  provider: { '@id': new URL('/#organization', Astro.site).href },
  areaServed: 'GB',
  description:
    'One service in three stages: a £30 audit of how AI assistants currently answer questions about your business, a £350 one-off Foundation setup that makes your business readable and credible to those systems, and ongoing monthly plans that keep you visible.',
  offers: [
    {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      name: 'Audit',
      price: '30',
      priceCurrency: 'GBP',
      description:
        'One-off written report on how AI assistants currently answer questions about your business, what they believe about you, and what is blocking you from being recommended.',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      name: 'Foundation',
      price: '350',
      priceCurrency: 'GBP',
      description:
        'One-off setup on your existing website: crawler access, structured data, consistent business facts, and pages that answer the questions your customers ask AI assistants.',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      name: 'Maintain (monthly)',
      price: '75',
      priceCurrency: 'GBP',
      description:
        'Monthly plan to stay found: keeps your information current, monitors how AI assistants answer questions about your business, and fixes drift. £75 per month.',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      name: 'Grow (monthly)',
      price: '125',
      priceCurrency: 'GBP',
      description:
        'Monthly plan to get found more: everything in Maintain, plus new answer-focused content each month so you appear for more of the questions your customers ask. £125 per month.',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      name: 'Lead (monthly)',
      price: '250',
      priceCurrency: 'GBP',
      description:
        'Monthly plan for businesses that want to be the default recommendation in their field: everything in Grow, at a faster pace and broader coverage, with a quarterly written review. £250 per month.',
    },
  ],
};
---

<Base title={title} description={description} schema={[serviceSchema]}>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>What does Noven cost?</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        One service, three stages, plain numbers. You start with a £30 audit, and every stage
        after that is only worth buying if the one before says so.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="price-block" style="border-top: none; padding-top: 0;">
        <div class="price-line">
          <h2>Audit</h2>
          <span class="price">£30 <small>one-off</small></span>
        </div>
        <p>
          A written report on where your business currently stands with the major AI assistants —
          ChatGPT, Google's AI results, Copilot and Perplexity. We ask them the questions your
          customers ask, record what comes back, and diagnose why.
        </p>
        <p>You get:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>What each assistant currently says when asked about businesses like yours.</li>
          <li>What they know and believe about your business, and whether it's accurate.</li>
          <li>The specific things blocking you, in plain English.</li>
          <li>Our honest recommendation — including "you're fine, don't spend more money."</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Book the £30 audit</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="price-block">
        <div class="price-line">
          <h2>Foundation</h2>
          <span class="price">£350 <small>one-off</small></span>
        </div>
        <p>
          The setup that gets you visible, scoped by your audit and done on the website you
          already have. It covers crawler access for the AI systems, structured machine-readable
          facts about your business, consistency of those facts across the web, and pages that
          directly answer the questions your customers ask. Most Foundations complete within
          [PLACEHOLDER: typical delivery time].
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="price-block">
        <div class="price-line">
          <h2>Ongoing</h2>
          <span class="price">from £75 <small>per month</small></span>
        </div>
        <p>
          The assistants change constantly, so staying visible is maintenance, not magic. Pick the
          level of effort that matches your ambition — all three are the same service, at
          different intensities, and you can move between them.
        </p>

        <div class="price-block" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <div class="price-line">
            <h3>Maintain — stay found</h3>
            <span class="price">£75 <small>/month</small></span>
          </div>
          <p>
            Keeps what the Foundation built working: your information stays current and
            consistent, we monitor how the assistants answer questions about you, and we fix
            things when they drift.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="price-block">
          <div class="price-line">
            <h3>Grow — get found more</h3>
            <span class="price">£125 <small>/month</small></span>
          </div>
          <p>
            Everything in Maintain, plus new answer-focused content each month, so over time you
            show up for more of the questions your customers actually ask — more specialisms,
            more locations, more situations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="price-block">
          <div class="price-line">
            <h3>Lead — front of mind</h3>
            <span class="price">£250 <small>/month</small></span>
          </div>
          <p>
            For businesses that want to be the default recommendation in their field. Everything
            in Grow at a faster pace and broader coverage, plus a quarterly written review of
            where you stand against the competitors the assistants name.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        All prices are [PLACEHOLDER: confirm whether prices include VAT]. Monthly plans roll month
        to month — no long contracts. [PLACEHOLDER: confirm cancellation notice period.]
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>Why is the audit only £30?</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Because finding out where you stand should be an easy decision, not a leap of faith. The
          audit is real work and stands on its own — you could take the report to someone else, or
          act on it yourself. We price it low because we'd rather earn the follow-on work on the
          strength of what the report shows.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
